          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kūlwa kūbalombela ū Danyeli a ba Shadulaka, Meshaki nū Abedinego, ū ntemi akabīīta kūbiza basugi nabo ū mu sī ya Babuloni. Ū wei ū Danyeli ūbiza a h'ikūlū.",
          "type": "text",
